        <div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Private online counseling</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Language</dt><dd>English, German, Ukrainian, Russian</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Session length</dt><dd>Standard: 60 minutes. 90- or 120-minute sessions can be arranged when deeper work needs more time.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Rhythm</dt><dd>Usually weekly; more frequent in acute phases, and biweekly when appropriate</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Payment</dt><dd>Due upon booking</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Cancellation</dt><dd>Free up to 48 hours before; full fee within 48 hours</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a href="{{ page_url('about') }}#work-approach" class="brand-link">Read about my work approach</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="counseling-about"><div class="container counseling-about__grid">
    <header class="counseling-about__header"><h2>Who am I?</h2>
      <p class="counseling-about__personal-note">Hi, I’m Anna, a medical doctor and psychologist who runs an online practice supporting people around the world.</p>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DPgoOMZCIaG/?img_index=1" class="btn-secondary counseling-about__story" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read my story</a>
    </header>
    <div class="counseling-about__content">
      <ul class="counseling-about__proof-list">
        <li>Medical doctor and psychologist</li>
        <li>I use an integrative approach, choosing the methods that fit the person and the problem.</li>
        <li>Having been through burnout and depression myself, I know how it feels.</li>
        <li>I love my work and care deeply about every client I work with.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
