  </div></section>

  <section class="counseling-investment"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2>Sessions and investment</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-weight: var(--font-weight-body); max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">As we have built our emotional patterns over time, we also need consistent work and continuity to change them. The six-session package exists for that reason.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="split-grid pricing-layout" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: stretch; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="pricing-card popular" style="text-align: center; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--color-accent); padding: 3rem 2.5rem;">
        <span class="pricing-badge" style="background-color: var(--color-burgundy); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); letter-spacing: 0.05em; top: -12px;">Recommended</span>
        <h3>Counseling Package</h3>
        <div class="pricing-price" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><span class="amount" style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);">660€</span><span class="period" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">/ 6 sessions (110€/session)</span></div>
